{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12350","headline":"过鸣臯隐者 · 钱起","name":"过鸣臯隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"磻石老红鲜，徴君卧几年。\n飞泉出林下，一径过崖巅。\n鸡犬逐人静，云霞宜地偏。\n终朝数峰胜，不远一壶前。\n仲月霁春雨，香风生药田。\n丹溪不可别，琼草色芊芊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}